Value Filldown INSTANCE (\S+)
Value RD (\S+)
Value PEER (\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+)
Value TUNNEL_ADDRESS (\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+)
Value ENCAPSULATION (\S+)
Value Required VNI (\d+)

# EVPN IMET routes: the remote VTEPs that joined each VSI's flooding list.
Start
  ^\s*Total number of automatically discovered peers:\s*\d+\s*$$
  ^\s*VSI name:\s*${INSTANCE}\s*$$
  ^RD\s+PE_address\s+Tunnel_address\s+Tunnel mode\s+VXLAN ID\s*$$
  ^${RD}\s+${PEER}\s+${TUNNEL_ADDRESS}\s+${ENCAPSULATION}\s+${VNI}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*$$
  ^. -> Error "unrecognized display evpn auto-discovery imet line"
